coreruleset (4.25.1-0keel1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First Keel package (handbook decision 0041, first implementation,
    step 5): the OWASP Core Rule Set version 4, LTS line, for Coraza.
    Debian has only CRS 3.3 (modsecurity-crs, 3.3.7 in trixie and 3.3.9
    in forky and sid), which Coraza does not target, and no package of
    CRS 4.
  * Rules and data in /usr/share/coreruleset/rules; crs-setup.conf, the
    two exclusion files and the plugin stubs as conffiles in
    /etc/coreruleset, as modsecurity-crs does in /etc/modsecurity/crs;
    /usr/share/coreruleset/coreruleset.load includes them in CRS's order.

